---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Placeholder from '../assets/acRepair.JPEG';
---

<!-- Location Hero Wrapper -->
<div class="bg-[#08439d] py-16 mt-10">

  <!-- Title -->
  <section class="text-white text-center px-6">
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6">
      We Service Port Richey, FL, and the Surrounding Areas
    </h2>
  </section>

  <!-- Description -->
  <section class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 mt-6">
    <div class="lg:w-3/4 xl:w-2/3 mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-white text-lg md:text-2xl leading-relaxed fontchange">
        Our company provides dependable, full-service HVAC solutions for customers throughout the West Central Coast.
        We handle air conditioning repair, AC maintenance, AC installation, and emergency AC repair. Whether you’re looking for
        a traditional central AC system or an energy-efficient ductless mini-split, our experienced team can help you choose
        and install the ideal cooling system.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Image + Location List -->
  <section class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start px-6 md:px-10 gap-12 mt-12">

    <!-- Image Block -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-full md:w-4/5 shadow-2xl rounded-2xl border-4 border-white">
        <div class="flex items-center bg-white px-4 py-3 rounded-t-2xl">
          <p class="text-[#007dfc] text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mx-auto">
            (We Offer Same-Day Service!)
          </p>
        </div>
        <Image 
          src={Placeholder} 
          alt="AC Unit Repair" 
          class="w-full h-80 md:h-96 object-cover rounded-b-2xl"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Location Links -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-y-6 text-white text-lg md:text-2xl leading-relaxed font-medium">
        <li><a href="/locations/port-richey-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Port Richey, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/new-port-richey-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ New Port Richey, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/trinity-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Trinity, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/tarpon-springs-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Tarpon Springs, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/oldsmar-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Oldsmar, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/odessa-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Odessa, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/land-o-lakes-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Land O' Lakes, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/spring-hill-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Spring Hill, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/palm-harbor-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Palm Harbor, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/dunedin-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Dunedin, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/holiday-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Holiday, FL</a></li>
        <li><a href="/locations/hudson-fl" class="hover:underline">✓ Hudson, FL</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- Additional Description -->
  <div class="text-white text-lg md:text-xl mt-12 space-y-6 px-4 md:px-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p>Our experienced HVAC team provides reliable air conditioning repair, installation, and maintenance with a focus on fast service and long-term comfort. Whether you're dealing with a breakdown or planning an upgrade, we’re here to help with honest solutions and expert care.</p>
    <p>We work with a wide range of systems—from standard central AC units to ductless mini-splits and smart thermostats. Every install and repair is handled by certified technicians who prioritize efficiency, safety, and clean workmanship.</p>
    <p>Emergency service is available when you need it most, along with routine maintenance plans to prevent costly issues down the road. We tailor our recommendations based on your home, budget, and energy goals.</p>
    <p>Our approach is built on transparency, clear communication, and dependable results. Whether it’s your first service call or your fifth system upgrade, we aim to be the team you trust for all your cooling and heating needs.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .fontchange {
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }
</style>
